<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0092_D26R0103_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ to see SLOWPOKE\nevolve. Been watchin’ a while,\fand I found somethin’ out.\rA SLOWPOKE holdin’ a King’s Rock\nusually get bit by a SHELLDER.\rHere, take a King’s Rock.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0092_D26R0103_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
